OL,3,GNEWSA'One in a million' son killed in
OL,4,Atractor crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who was killed when
OL,7,Fthe car he was travelling in collided
OL,8,Fwith a tractor trailer have paid
OL,9,Ftribute to their "one in a million"
OL,10,Fson.
OL,12,FAlfie Miller, 19, died in a crash near
OL,13,FSelby on Monday on the A163 at Barlby,
OL,14,Fnear the junction with Whitemoor Lane.
OL,16,FHe was travelling in a blue Range Rover
OL,17,FSVR when it collided with a trailer
OL,18,Floaded with hay bales being towed by a
OL,19,FMassey Ferguson tractor. He died at
OL,20,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
