OL,3,GNEWSA'One in a million' son killed in
OL,4,Atractor crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement provided to North
OL,7,FYorkshire Police, his family described
OL,8,Fhim as "the most kind, loving and
OL,9,Fambitious young man you could have ever
OL,10,Fmet".
